1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sigurd_Hjort
2 CONT
2 CONT http://lind.no/nor/index.asp?lang=&emne=nor&person=Sigurd%20Hjort%20%28Helgesson%29
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Snorre anfører Halvdans andre hustru som datter til Sigurd Hiort, konge på Romerike, større og sterkere enn alle andre. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Det sies at Sigurd, bare 12 år gammel, drepte berserken Hildebrand og 11 av hans menn i enekamp. Sigurd øvet mange storverk, men en dag han red på jakt etter storvilt, ble han drept av Hake berserk med 30 menn nær Hadeland. Hake f
2 CONC ørte Ragnhild til sin gård på Hadeland og holdt henne der, men måtte senere gi henne til Halvdan Svarte.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigurd skulle være sønn til Helge "den Kvasse" og Åslaug, datter til Sigurd Orm-i-øye, hvis far var Ragnar Lodbrok fra den sagnpregede Lodbrokslekten. Slekten skal ha etterfulgt Ynglingeslekten som konger av Sverige fra 655 til 78
2 CONC 5. Det er uklart hvor stor del av Sverige slekten regjerte over. Den ble etterfulgt av Munsöslekten som egentlig var en gren av Lodbrokslekten. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigurd Hart or Sigurd Hjort was a legendary king of Ringerike in Norway, who appears in Ragnarssona þáttr and in Halfdan the Black's saga.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnarssona þáttr informs that he was the son of Helgi the Sharp (the great-great-grandson of king Ring of Ringerike) of the Dagling dynasty and Aslaug. She was the daughter of Sigurd Snake-in-the-Eye (one of Ragnar Lodbrok's sons
2 CONC ) and Blaeja, the daughter of king Aelle II of Northumbria. When Sigurd Hart was only twelve years old he slew a berserker named Hildibrand in a duel, and twelve other men. He married Ingeborg, the daughter of the Jutish chieftain
2 CONC  Harald Klak. Sigurd and Ingeborg had the children Guttorm and Ragnhild. When his uncle king Fróði of Ringerike died, Sigurd went to Norway to succeed him as king.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnarssona þáttr and Halfdan the Black's saga relate that a berseker from Hadeland named Haki killed Sigurd, but lost a hand in the fight. Then Haki went to Sigurd's residence at Stein and took Sigurd's children Ragnhild and Gutt
2 CONC orm. Haki returned with the children and all the loot to Hadeland. Before Haki recuperated from his wounds and could marry the 15 or 20 year old Ragnhild, she was captured a second time, by Halfdan the Black. Halfdan and Ragnhild 
2 CONC were the parents of Harald Fairhair.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT From Snorre Sturlasson: Halvdan Svarte [Halfdan the Black] Saga:
2 CONT
2 CONT "5. HALFDAN'S MARRIAGE WITH HJORT'S DAUGHTER.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigurd Hjort was the name of a king in Ringerike, who was stouter and stronger than any other man, and his equal could not be seen for a handsome appearance. His father was Helge Hvasse (the Sharp); and his mother was Aslaug, a da
2 CONC ughter of Sigurd the worm- eyed, who again was a son of Ragnar Lodbrok. It is told of Sigurd that when he was only twelve years old he killed in single combat the berserk Hildebrand, and eleven others of his comrades; and many are
2 CONC  the deeds of manhood told of him in a long saga about his feats. Sigurd had two children, one of whom was a daughter, called Ragnhild, then twenty years of age, and an excellent brisk girl. Her brother Guthorm was a youth. It is 
2 CONC related in regard to Sigurd's death that he had a custom of riding out quite alone in the uninhabited forest to hunt the wild beasts that are hurtful to man, and he was always very eager at this sport. One day he rode out into the
2 CONC  forest as usual, and when he had ridden a long way he came out at a piece of cleared land near to Hadeland. There the berserk Hake came against him with thirty men, and they fought. Sigurd Hjort fell there, after killing twelve o
2 CONC f Hake's men; and Hake himself lost one hand, and had three other wounds."
2 CONT
2 CONT   Noted events in his life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • He was employed. King.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigurd married Tyrne av Jutland, daughter of Klakk-Harald av Jutland and Unknown. (Tyrne av Jutland was born in 825.)
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT http://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/Halvdan_Svarte
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnhilds far, Sigurd Hjort, var den gang eier av Stein gård i Hole på Ringerike. Berserken Håke drepte først Sigurd Hjort og røvet deretter Ragnhild. Halvdan Svarte reddet Ragnhild og giftet seg med henne. Han skal ha bosatt seg 
2 CONC på Stein gård. Han utgjør en av de 4 kongene i kommunevåpenet til Hole kommune.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigurd Hart or Sigurd Hjort was a legendary king of Ringerike in Norway, who appears in Ragnarssona þáttr and in Halfdan the Black's saga.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnarssona þáttr informs that he was the son of Helgi the Sharp (the great-great-grandson of king Ring of Ringerike) of the Dagling dynasty and Aslaug. She was the daughter of Sigurd Snake-in-the-Eye (one of Ragnar Lodbrok's sons
2 CONC ) and Blaeja, the daughter of king Aelle II of Northumbria. When Sigurd Hart was only twelve years old he slew a berserker named Hildibrand in a duel, and twelve other men. He married Ingeborg, the daughter of the Jutish chieftain
2 CONC  Harald Klak. Sigurd and Ingeborg had the children Guttorm and Ragnhild. When his uncle king Fróði of Ringerike died, Sigurd went to Norway to succeed him as king.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnarssona þáttr and Halfdan the Black's saga relate that a berseker from Hadeland named Haki killed Sigurd, but lost a hand in the fight. Then Haki went to Sigurd's residence at Stein and took Sigurd's children Ragnhild and Gutt
2 CONC orm. Haki returned with the children and all the loot to Hadeland. Before Haki recuperated from his wounds and could marry the 15 or 20 year old Ragnhild, she was captured a second time, by Halfdan the Black. Halfdan and Ragnhild 
2 CONC were the parents of Harald Fairhair.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Född : Mellan 810 och 815 , Ringerike , Norge 
2 CONT
2 CONT Äktenskap : Tyrne AV Jylland 
2 CONT
2 CONT Död: 856 , Ringerike , Norge 
2 CONT
2 CONT Orsaken till hans död var han dödades . 
2 CONT
2 CONT   Allmänna hänvisningar: 
2 CONT
2 CONT Från Snorre Sturlassons : Halvdan Svarte [ Halfdan svarte ] Saga :
2 CONT
2 CONT " 5 . Halfdan äktenskap med Hjort dotter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigurd Hjort var namnet på en kung i Ringerike , som var stouter och starkare än någon annan man , och hans lika kunde inte ses för en vacker utseende. Hans far var Helge Hvasse ( Sharp ) , och hans mor var Aslög , dotter till Sig
2 CONC urd mask öga , som en gång var son till Ragnar Lodbrok . Det berättas om Sigurd att när han bara var tolv år gammal han dödade i envig den bärsärkagång Hildebrand, och elva andra av hans kamrater , och många är de gärningar manlig
2 CONC het berättade om honom i en lång saga om hans bedrifter. Sigurd fick två barn, varav en var en dotter , kallad Ragnhild , sedan tjugo år, och en utmärkt rask flicka. Hennes bror Guthorm var en ungdom. Det berättas i fråga om Sigur
2 CONC ds död , att han hade en vana att rida ut helt ensam i den obebodda skogen för att jaga de vilda djuren som är skadliga för människan , och han var alltid mycket angelägen i denna sport . En dag red han ut i skogen som vanligt, oc
2 CONC h när han hade ridit en lång väg han kom ut på en bit röjde nära Hadeland . Där bärsärkagång Kummel kom mot honom med trettio män, och de slogs . Sigurd Hjort föll det , efter nedläggningen tolv av Kummel män , och Hake själv förl
2 CONC orade en hand och hade tre andra sår. "
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Sigurd Hart or Sigurd Hjort was a legendary king of Ringerike in Norway, who appears in Ragnarssona þáttr and in Halfdan the Black's saga.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnarssona þáttr informs that he was the son of Helgi the Sharp (the great-great-grandson of king Ring of Ringerike) of the Dagling dynasty and Aslaug. She was the daughter of Sigurd Snake-in-the-Eye (one of Ragnar Lodbrok's sons
2 CONC ) and Blaeja, the daughter of king Aelle II of Northumbria. When Sigurd Hart was only twelve years old he slew a berserker named Hildibrand in a duel, and twelve other men. He married Ingeborg, the daughter of the Jutish chieftain
2 CONC  Harald Klak. Sigurd and Ingeborg had the children Guttorm and Ragnhild. When his uncle king Fróði of Ringerike died, Sigurd went to Norway to succeed him as king.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnarssona þáttr and Halfdan the Black's saga relate that a berseker from Hadeland named Haki killed Sigurd, but lost a hand in the fight. Then Haki went to Sigurd's residence at Stein and took Sigurd's children Ragnhild and Gutt
2 CONC orm. Haki returned with the children and all the loot to Hadeland. Before Haki recuperated from his wounds and could marry the 15 or 20 year old Ragnhild, she was captured a second time, by Halfdan the Black. Halfdan and Ragnhild 
2 CONC were the parents of Harald Fairhair.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT http://www.lawrencefamhis.com/ancestors-o/p996.htm#i24886
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Sigurd var starkare och större än alla andra. Han var också vackrarae än de flesta. Det berättas att är han var tolv år dräpte han själv Hildebrand berserk och tolv andra män av samma slag. han utförde många "manliga dåd".Det berä
2 CONC ttas att han dog när han som vanligt vistades i skogen, jande vilda djur, nära Hadeland där Hake Berserk hade sin gård. Hake kom emot honom med 30 man. De utkämpade en strid och Sigurd föll tillsammans med tolv av de Hakes män.  H
2 CONC ake miste en arm och fick flera andra skador.  Efter att de dödat Sigurd red Hake till Sigurds farm där han stal guld och silver och andra värdefulla föremål. Han tog med sig Sigurds dotter, Ragnhild och sonen Guttorm.  Ragnhild v
2 CONC ar då 20 år och mycket vacker. Han ställde till en fest och ville gifta sig med Ragnhild. Hans sår förvärrades och satte stopp för giftemålet. Hans blev sängliggande hela hösten och första delen av vintern.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Snorre: Konge på Romerike. Kjent for å være større og sterkere enn alle andre. Det sies at han bare 12 år gammel drepte  berserken Hildebrand og 11 av hans menn i en enekamp. Sigurd røvet mange storverk, men en dag han var ute på 
2 CONC jakt ble han  drept av Hake Berserk. Hake tok da datteren Ragnhild med seg til garden sin, men måtte senere gi henne til Halvdan Svarte.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Kung i Ringerike och Oplandene, Norge.
