2 CONT
2 CONT OCCUPATION: Dronning
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH: ABT 0835, ('den Kloke') 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father: Sigurd Helgeson HJORT 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother: Tyrne Haraldsdatter KLAKK 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family 1 : Halvdan SVARTE 
2 CONT
2 CONT MARRIAGE: 0849 
2 CONT
2 CONT +Harald (Luva) HÅRFAGRE 
2 CONT
2 CONT Kilde: nermo.org
2 CONT
