2 CONT  HAROLD V14 (Gormon ANGLE13, Frotho12, Cnute "the Little"11, Eric "the Usurper"10, Eric "the Bern"9, Siward "the Snake-Eyed"8, Ivar7, Regner6, Siward5, Hemming4, Olaus3, Gotrick2, Gormon1), son of (13) Gormon13 II, has an unknown 
2 CONC birthdate.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 		i.	GORMON15 III. +		ii.	SON.
