2 CONT * http://www.norsesaga.no/hvorledes-norge-ble-bosatt.html
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT '''Sigar''' is a character in ''Volsunga saga''. See [https://www.geni.com/people/Sigar-Halvdanson-Hversum-Noreg-Byggdist/6000000078621663046 Sigar Halvdansson] for the same character in ''Hversum Noreg Byggdist''. 
2 CONT
