1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From "The Ynglinga Saga":
2 CONT
2 CONT "51. OF KING EYSTEIN'S DEATH.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eystein, Halfdan Hvitbein's son, became king after in Raumarike and Westfold. He was married to Hild, a daughter of Eric Agnarsson, who was king in Westfold. Agnar, Eric's father, was a son of Sigtryg, king in the Vend district. K
2 CONC ing Eric had no son, and died while King Halfdan Hvitbein was still in life. ..."
2 CONT
2 CONT   Noted events in his life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • He was a King of Westfold.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Från "The Ynglinga Saga " :
2 CONT
2 CONT " 51 . Kung Eystein död.
2 CONT
2 CONT Eystein , Halfdan Hvitbein son, blev konung efter i Raumarike och Västfold . Han var gift med Hild , en dotter till Eric Agnarsson, Som var kung i Västfold . Agnar , Eriks far, var son till Sigtryg , kung i SALUFÖRA stadsdelen. Ku
2 CONC ng Erik hade ingen son , och dog medan kung Halfdan Hvitbein fortfarande var i livet. ... "
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 Wikipedia ( http://en.wikipedia.org/ ). 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 Snorre Sturlasson (ca 1179 till 1241 ), http://sunsite.berkeley.edu/OMACL/ ( Om 1225 ), The Ynglinga Saga . 
2 CONT
