1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==brief biography==
2 CONT Legendary Scandinavian king, known from a recital of ancestors in "Hversum Noregr Byggdist".
2 CONT
2 CONT Gor hadde øyene, derfor ble han kalt "sjøkonge". Sønnene hans het Heite og Beite, de var også sjøkonger og store villstyringer Heite Gors sønn var far til Sveide sjøkonge, far til Halvdan den gamle, far til Ivar Opplendingejarl, f
2 CONC ar til Øystein Glumra, far til Ragnvald jarl den mektige og den rådsnare. 
2 CONT _________________________________________________________________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT From Google translate: Gor had the islands, which is why he was called "sea king". His sons were named Heite and Beite, they were also sea kings and great wild rulers. Heite Gor's son was the father of Sveide the sea king, the fat
2 CONC her of Halvdan the old, the father of Ivar Earl of Opplending, the father of Øystein Glumra, the father of Earl Ragnvald the mighty and the wise in counsel.
