2 CONT descendent from Heytir Gorrson (b. ~425); called his "son"
1 NOTE Svidri Heytsson was born in 600 and married Mrs Svidri Heytsson in Norway and their only known child was Sveidi "sea King Svidrasson. The Orknetinga Saga says that the father of Sveidi was Heiti Gorsson, skipping Svidri in the lin
2 CONC eage. Hetti was boca 425 at Raumsdahl, so it is already a long stretch exoplaining a 175 year gap between father and son, yet this seems to be accepted bt all those who have put in pedigree charts.
1 NOTE _P_CCINFO 1-2782
1 NOTE Sveidi (Sveithi) "the Sea King" Svidrasson and Mrs Sveidi Svidrasson are also not very well documented. No dates of death, no children mentioned except Halfdan
