2 CONC her of Eylima, father of Hjordi, mother of Sigurdar Fafnisbana, father of '''Aslaug''', mother of Sigurd Serpent-Eye, father of Aslaug, mother of Sigurd Hjarta, father of Ragnhild, mother of Harald Fair-haired. These relatives of 
2 CONC Harald are called Lofdungs." The father of Sigurd *Serpent -eye' was Ragnar 'Lodbrok' Sigurdsson son of Sigurd Ring Randversson King of Swedes and Danes. 
2 CONT There are lots of miscalculations in peoples ages. For instance Ragnar was born 793/95 and died in Northumberland 863 killed by King Aella and his men. He was the documented leader of the attack on Paris 845 with 120 ships  and 40
2 CONC -50000 men up the river Seine.
2 CONT He was apparently in his 70-ies when he died. After Ragnars second wife Thora Herrödsdotter in Sweden died young he was depressed and restless and sailed away raiding. He then came to the very southmost part of Norway Lindesnes Sp
2 CONC angareid where he met Aslög.That is assumed to have happened  appr 822 when Rgnar wa appr 27 years old Remember that Ragnar with his first partner Gerda Hålgadatter, Ladgerda, had three documented children, one son Fridleif and tw
2 CONC o unnamed daughters.RAgnar and LAdgerda met in their teens in LAde todays TRondheim.  After some years of parenthood he left Ladgerda to deal with an  uprising against him in Denmark. Some chieftains and seaking had the opinion th
2 CONC at he was to young to be King over such a big Kingdom. By the time he was there he was invited to Earl Herröd in Est Geatland Sweden who wanted him to marry his daughter Thora. Ragnar and Thora had two sons,Erik and Agnar that ver
2 CONC y small when Thora hasty díed. Anyway Ragnar after this married Aslög and they had 9 children : Ivar 'Boneless', Björn 'Ironside', Sigurd  'Serpenteye', Halvdan 'Vitserk' Rognvald, Ragnhild, Hastein, ( Husto ) , Aalof, Radbard, Ub
2 CONC be was the result of Ragnars visit to Frisland where he met Gisla Esbjörnsdaughter. All Ragnars known children were born and lived during the 800-eds.
