2 CONT Yngling family
2 CONT
2 CONT The main family of early Norwegian kings was founded by one Gudrod Halfdansson Veidelkonge, King of Westfold; m.Asa Haraldsdottir. They were parents of:
2 CONT
2 CONT Halfdan III "the Black", King of Westfold (830-863), +863/870; 1m: Ragnhild, dau.of King Harald Gullskiegg of Sogn; 2m: Ragnhild, dau.of King Sigurd Hjort Helgasson of Ringerike; by her he was father of:
2 CONT
