2 CONT Godefrid, 6th King of Haithabu
2 CONT
2 CONT M, #42856, d. 810
2 CONT
2 CONT Last Edited=9 Aug 2004
2 CONT
2 CONT     Godefrid, 6th King of Haithabu was the son of Halfdan Mildi, King of Westfold and Lif (?). He died in 810, murdered.
2 CONT
2 CONT     Godefrid, 6th King of Haithabu gained the title of Hedemarken of Westfold. He gained the title of King Godefrid of Westfold, Hedeland, Vaermland, and Westmare. He gained the title of 6th King Godefrid of Haithabu.
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of Godefrid, 6th King of Haithabu
