2 CONT 6. DOMALDE - A Swedish King who died in 130 A.D. During his reign, Sweden was ravaged by famine. No amount of sacrifice would appease the gods, so at last it was decided to offer the King as a human sacrifice. This was done and th
2 CONC e country then had good crops and people lived in peace. His son was:
