2 CONT -------------------- http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/D%C3%B3maldi <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> Domalde, Dómaldi or Dómaldr was a Swedish king of the House of Ynglings, in Norse mythology. He was the son of Visbur.
