1 NOTE Halfdan Sveidrasson was another fairly unknown petty Kings of Norway. According to the Wikipedia, there were about 9 in Western Norway and 20 in the whole country, between the death of Harald Fairfair and the unification of Norway
2 CONC  in 872, and someo more than a cluster of villages. He married Mrs Halfdan Sveidasson in Oppland in about 749
