1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Sir Gauvain de Wissocq
2 CONT * Seigneur de Wissocq1
2 CONT * Last Edited	18 Mar 2012
2 CONT * M, #150921, b. circa 1238, d. 1297
2 CONT * Father	Sir Philibert de Wissocq, Seigneur de Wissocq1 b. c 1196, d. 1257
2 CONT * Mother	Angélique d' Aire1 b. c 1206, d. 1264
2 CONT
2 CONT Sir Gauvain de Wissocq, Seigneur de Wissocq was born circa 1238 at of St. Omer, Pas-de-Calais, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.1 He married Isabelle de St. Omer, daughter of Bela de St. Omer, Lord of Thebes and Bonne de la Roche-sur-l'
2 CONC Ognon, circa 1261.1 Sir Gauvain de Wissocq, Seigneur de Wissocq died in 1297.1
2 CONT
