1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 1192 (RA. Kortrijk, Merkem, charter noè 5) - 1202, March (RA. Bruges, Blue no. 6672).
2 CONT Chamberlain of Flanders (RA. Kortrijk, Merkem, charter no. 5 (1192))
2 CONT "Baro" (Nonnenbossche, no. XVI, p. 73 (1198, August 17)).
2 CONT nob. (Hist. Oudenbourg, II, p. 99 (1196)).
2 CONT x Catherine, daughter of Gerard of Bailleul, castellan of Oudenburg (Le Chambellan, P.J., no. I, p. MI). After the death of Baldwin she remarried Giles I Bertout of Mechlin by whom she had several children (Giles II, daughters, Le
2 CONC wis, Walter, John, Godfrey) (see TH. LUSKX, Een typisch vertegenwoordiger van de XIlle-eenwse adel in onze gewesten : Gillis I Berthout met den Baard, kamerheer van Vlaanderen en broeder van de Duitse Orde in Pitsemburg te Mechele
2 CONC n, Mededelingen van de Koninklijke Vlaamse Academie .. Klasse Letteren, VIth year, no. 3; A. GOBTSTOUWERS, Gillis Berthout en de eerSte heren van Berlaar, Geel en Dufel, Handelingen Koninklike Kring voor Oudheidkun- de, Letteren e
2 CONC n Kunst te Mechelen, Vol. 56, pp. 24-25 (under reserve)); nob. (NDTournai, cartul. D, f° 253 r°).
2 CONT Chlidren:
2 CONT - Eustace III (ARA. Brussels, Trésor de Flandre, First Series, no. 2390 (1217 (n.s.), February)).
2 CONT - Gerard (Chron. et cartul. mon. de Dunis, p. 493 (1217, July)).
2 CONT (Warlop, 862-853)
2 CONT _______________
2 CONT BAUDOUIN de Grammines (-[1201/04]).  His parentage is confirmed by the charter dated 15 Jun 1220 under which [his son] “Eustachius Flandrie camerarius” confirmed the donation of eel fisheries made by “domina Katerina mater mea et 
2 CONC dominus Egidius Bartouth maritus eius et...avus [...pie memorie dominus Eustacius avus meus quondam Flandrie camerariuset avia mea” to Dunes abbey[985].  Chambellan de Flandre. 
2 CONT
2 CONT [Footnote [985] Dunes, CCCCXL-No. 560, p. 509 “Medievalands.” MedievaLands, https://medievalands.com/.]
