2 CONT 2.         EUSTACHE de Houdain .  Du Chesne names “Anselme III Seigneur de Houdain, Eustache de Houdain Seigneur de Choques et Geofroy de Houdain” as the children of “Anselme II Seigneur de Houdain” but he does not cite the corres
2 CONC ponding primary sources[463].  Seigneur de Choques (part).  m ---.  The name of Eustache’s wife is not known.  Eustache & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT
2 CONT b)         HUGUES de Houdain .  Du Chesne names “Anselme de Houdain dit de Choques Seigneur du mesme lieu...Hugues de Houdain aussi Seigneur de Choques en partie” as the children of “Eustache de Houdain Seigneur de Choques” but he
2 CONC  does not cite the corresponding primary sources[465].  m as her second husband, MATHILDE de Béthune, widow of GAUTHIER de Bourbourg, daughter of ROBERT [V] "le Roux" Seigneur de Béthune & his wife Adelaide --- (-7 Dec 1220).   … 
2 CONC She married thirdly as his second wife, Baudouin [II] de Comines. … 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugues & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT i)          ALIX de Houdain (-23 Feb after Jun 1248). …   It has not yet been ascertained whether Alix was her mother’s daughter by her known marriage or by her possible second marriage.  The necrology of Choques records the death
2 CONC  “VII Kal Mar” of “Adelidis de Calceia domina de Choques”[476].  m JEAN de Cauchy, son of ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugues I d' Heuchin, Seigneur d'Heuchin was born circa 1151 at of Heuchin, Pas-de-Calais, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mathilde de Bethune, daughter of Robert V de Bethune, Sire de Bethune, Richebourg, Warneton, & Chocques, Vogt von Arras and Adelaide de St. Pol, on 16 May 1171 at Bethune, Pas-de-Calais, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France; This
2 CONC  marriage is not in ES, Vol. XXVII, Tafel 19.2,1 
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugues I d' Heuchin, Seigneur d'Heuchin died in 1173 at of Heuchin, Pas-de-Calais, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT # Beatrix d' Heuchin+3 d. a 1212
2 CONT # Hugues II d' Heuchin, Seigneur d'Heuchin+1 b. c 1172, d. 1244
2 CONT
