2 CONC S449] Circa 1225 A.D. Snorri Sturluson, Chronicle of the Kings of Norway, The Ynglinga Saga. -------------------- Hálfdan Snälle Haraldsson, King of Roeskilde died. Killed by his brother, Gudrod, who did it at the urging of his wi
2 CONC fe, Aasa, daughter of Ingjald "the Evil-Advisor."5 He was born at Jutland, Denmark. He was the son of Haraldr Valdarsson, King of Roeskilde.4 Hálfdan Snälle Haraldsson, King of Roeskilde married Maolda (?) before 612.
