2 CONT Ivarr Vídfadmi Hálfdanarson, King of the Danes and Swedes|d. 647|p298.htm#i9378|Hálfdan Snälle Haraldsson, King of Roeskilde||p278.htm#i9379|Maolda (?)|b. c 590|p78.htm#i10097|Haraldr V., King of Roeskilde||p78.htm#i10098|||||||||
