2 CONT 	2  NICK Vidfame
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT [De La Pole.FTW]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources: Russell; RC 240; Kraentzler 1655.   RC: Ivar Halfdansson, Woden-born King of Uppsala in Sweden, by conqust. King of Lethra, c690.
2 CONT    K: Ivar Halfdansson, King of Sweden.
2 CONT    Russell: Ivar Vidfamer, King of the Danes.
2 CONT    Russell says Haldan Sniale and Alfo were parents of either Ivar or Gothilda. And that Olaf the Sharp-eyed, King of Rerik, was the father of either Haldan or Alfo.
