2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT The Scandinavian Earls of Orkney trace their descent from the noblest andmost heroic of the ruling dynasties of the north. Ivar, Prince of theUplands in Norway, who claimed a descent from the deified hero Thor, wasfather of Eystei
2 CONC n. [Sir Bernard Burke, Dormant, Abeyant, Forfeited, andExtinct Peerages, Burke's Peerage, Ltd., London, 1883, p. 492, Sinclair,Earl of Orkney]
