2 CONC t Solve, killed him, and brought Halfdan back as a prisoner. Halfdan was made a chieftain and later became a great king in Vestfold. He married Aase, daughter of Eystein the Severe, King of Hedmark and Upland. Halfdan died in his 
2 CONC bed as an old man in 740. 
