1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Åshild Ringsdotter (Áshildi Hringsdóttir)
2 CONT
2 CONT In English: Ashild Hringsdotter
2 CONT
2 CONT http://no.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%85shild_Ringsdatter
2 CONT
