2 CONT
2 CONT Gauthier & his wife had three children: 
2 CONT *a)         HENRI (-before Nov 1220).  The Historia Comitum Ghisnensium names "Henricum et Beatricem" as children of Gauthier de Bourbourg and his wife[1361]. 
2 CONT *b)         BEATRIX de Bourbourg (-Bourbourg Aug 1224).  The Historia Comitum Ghisnensium names "Henricum et Beatricem apud Broburgensem in claustro sanctimonialis" … m (before Mar 1200) ARNOUL Comte de Guines, son of BAUDOUIN Com
2 CONC te de Guines & his wife Christine d'Ardres (-1220, bur Ardres).
2 CONT *c)         CATHERINE (-after Nov 1220).  "Dominus Robertus, Wilhelmus, Joannes de Bethunia, fratres Danielis tunc temporis domini Bethuniensis, Atrebatensis advocati, et Amalricus de Fontenella, milites, Beatridis comitissa de Gi
2 CONC snes, et Katarina sorores" witnessed the charter dated Nov 1220 under which "Mathildis de Housdaing…domina de Chockes" donated property to the abbey of Saint-Jean-Baptiste de Choques[1368]
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/nfranord.htm#HuguesHoudainMMathildeBethune
2 CONT
2 CONT Hugues & his wife had one child: 
2 CONT *i)          ALIX de Houdain (-23 Feb after Jun 1248) It has not yet been ascertained whether Alix was her mother’s daughter by her known marriage or by her possible second marriage.  The necrology of Choques records the death “VI
2 CONC I Kal Mar” of “Adelidis de Calceia domina de Choques”[476].  m JEAN de Cauchy, son of ---. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/nfranord.htm#BaudouinCominesdied1218
2 CONT
2 CONT BAUDOUIN [II] de Comines (-1218).  Seigneur de Comines. …   m firstly BEATRIX, daughter of ---.  “Balduinus de Comminis cum Beatrice uxore mea” granted privileges at Comines to Nonnenbossche abbey by charter dated 1196[651].  m se
2 CONC condly as her third husband, MATHILDE de Béthune, widow firstly of GAUTHIER de Bourbourg, and secondly of HUGUES de Houdain, daughter of ROBERT [V] "le Roux" Seigneur de Béthune & his wife Adelaide --- (-7 Dec 1220).  Baudouin [II
2 CONC ] & his first wife had three children: … 
2 CONT
