1 NOTE This person's last name should indicate that her father is named "Eystein" but she is listed as the daughter of "Harald".  Also, she and her husband seem to have the same mother, but I have listed them as separate individuals beca
2 CONC use the birth dates are a couple of years off.  I am not sure.  If she is the same woman, then this seems to be a brother and sister marriage.
