2 CONC ther Ynglinger. The Queen Drott was a sister of King Dan Mikillati, from whom Denmark a took its name <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> In the Heimskringla, Snorri Sturluson wrote that Domar married Drott, the daughter of Danp
