1 NOTE He conquered or inherited large sections of Norway, Sweden and Denmark. His armies overran Europe.
1 NOTE He was the leader of a flotilla of 120 ships,which, in 1845, rode up the Seine to Paris. Charles the Bald paid them 7,000 pounds of silver so they wouldn's burn Paris.
