2 CONC he Fecund…Hlodvir…Ljot…Skuli” as the five sons of Thorfinn[834].  Snorre names "the Earls Hlodver, Arnfid, Ljot and Skule, the sons of Thorfin Hausakljufer" as rulers in Orkney when Queen Gunhild and her sons returned to Orkney[83
