2 CONC e five sons of Thorfinn[844].  Snorre names "the Earls Hlodver, Arnfid, Ljot and Skule, the sons of Thorfin Hausakljufer" as rulers in Orkney when [http://www.geni.com/people/Gunhild-Ossursdotter/6000000005049052310 Queen Gunhild]
