2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnhild ble gift tre ganger, med brødrene Håvard, Ljotn og Arnfinn Torfinnsson, sønner av Thorfinn I Rollo (Brico) "Hausakliffer" Einarsson og Grelod Duncansdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT Arnfinn's wife, Ragnhild Eiriksdatter, had Thorfinn I "Hausakljufer" Einarsson, Earl of Orkney killed, then married Havard. Ragnhild later convinced Havard's nephew, Einar Buttered-Bread, to kill Havard in return for her hand in m
2 CONC arriage. This made Einar very unpopular, so Ragnhild would have nothing to do with him. She sent for another of Havard's nephews, Einar Hard-Mouth, whom she talked into killing Einar Buttered-Bread. She abandoned Einar Hard-Mouth 
2 CONC and married Havard's brother, Ljot. Einar tried to take the islands by force, but the people preferred the sons of Thorfinn Skull-Splitter. Earl Ljot later had Einar put to death. Skuli was killed in battle trying to take Orkney f
2 CONC rom Ljot. Ljot died from a wound he got in a battle (which he won) with Earl (later King) Macbeth of Scotland, who had supported Skuli and was embarrassed by the defeat.
2 CONT
2 CONT Blodig arv : roman av Ragnhild Magerøy
