2 CONT Male Simon IV van VAERNEWYCK ca 1260
2 CONT Male Thomas I van VAERNEWYCK, Heer van Vaernewyck ca 1260-ca 1306
2 CONT Married to Jean III de CROIX, Heer van Mandre ca 1260-ca 1321 with
2 CONT Male Jean IV de CROIX, Heer van Croix ca 1278-ca 1325
