2 CONT .....
2 CONT https://books.google.com/books/content?id=B6IcDp-zIUAC&pg=PA905&img=1&zoom=3&hl=en&bul=1&sig=ACfU3U0iVmlUADBeT2Px4F4gmahC-8yxJg&ci=124%2C342%2C682%2C273&edge=0
2 CONT
2 CONT '''V'''
2 CONT WAUTIER de Hallwin II du nom chevalier seigneur de Rosbeck vicomte d Harlebeck mort en 1338 fut inhumé à Harlebeck Femme ANNE de Vigeilsuliet morte en 1340 & enterrée avec son mary DANIEL de Hallwin qui fuit 
2 CONT
2 CONT > WAUTIER of Hallwin II, knight, lord of Rosbeck, viscount of Harlebeck, died in 1338 and was buried in Harlebeck. His wife, ANNE of Vigeilsuliet, died in 1340 and was buried with her husband, DANIEL of Hallwin, who follows
2 CONT
2 CONT '''VI'''
2 CONT DANIEL de Hallwin seigneur de Rosbeck vicomte d Harlebeck mayeur de Femme CATHERINE de Luxembourg fille de Jean de Luxembourg seigneur de Beaurevoir & d Alix de Flandres elle mourut l an 1366 
2 CONT 1 WAUTIER de Hallwin III du nom qui fuit 
2 CONT 2 ROGIER de Hallwin mort en 1368 & enterré à Rosbeck 1 Delgee mort l an 1365
2 CONT 3 THIERRY de Halwin mort fans alliance A 
2 CONT 4 MARIE de Hallwin femme de Jean Vanspeill seigneur de la Vichte morte en 1363 
2 CONT 5 CATHERINE de Hallwin mariée à Gautier Vender Mersen 
2 CONT 6 '''MARGUERITE de Hallwin alliée à Guillaume de Nevelle''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT > DANIEL of Hallwin, Lord of Rosbeck, Viscount of Harlebeck, Mayor of [unknown]. His wife, CATHERINE of Luxembourg, daughter of Jean of Luxembourg, Lord of Beaurevoir, and Alix of Flanders, died in 1366.
2 CONT 1. WAUTIER of Hallwin, the third of that name, who follows
2 CONT 2. ROGIER of Hallwin, died in 1368 and buried at Rosbeck.
2 CONT 3. THIERRY of Hallwin, died without marriage.
2 CONT 4. MARIE of Hallwin, wife of Jean Vanspeill, Lord of La Vichte, died in 1363.
2 CONT 5. CATHERINE of Hallwin, married to Gautier Vender Mersen.
2 CONT 6. '''MARGUERITE of Hallwin, married to Guillaume de Nevelle'''.
2 CONT
