2 CONT
2 CONT Simon de Wissocq, Seigneur de Wissocq, Master of the Waters & Forest of West Flanders was born circa 1302 at of St. Omer, Pas-de-Calais, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.1 He married Jeanne de Haveskerke, daughter of Pierre de Haveskerk
2 CONC e, Seigneur de Renescure, d'Isberque, & de Wisquette and Marie de Straeten, circa 1328.1 Simon de Wissocq, Seigneur de Wissocq, Master of the Waters & Forest of West Flanders died in 1359.1
