2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Sir Roger van Ghistelles, Captain of Damme1,2,3
2 CONT *'''M, #85796, d. after 1385
2 CONT *Father      Johann IV, Herr von Ghistelles1,2 d. 26 Aug 1346
2 CONT *Mother     Marie von Haveskerke1,2 b. c 1316, d. a 1350
2 CONT *'''     Sir Roger van Ghistelles, Captain of Damme married Maria van Lichtervelde; His 1st marriage.3 Sir Roger van Ghistelles, Captain of Damme and Elizabeth von Doornik obtained a marriage license on 13 August 1366.1,3 Sir Roge
2 CONC r van Ghistelles, Captain of Damme died after 1385.3
2 CONT *'''Family 1      Elizabeth von Doornik d. a 1357
2 CONT *Children
2 CONT **Isabelle van Ghistelles+1,4,3 d. 1435
2 CONT **Johann I von Ghistelles, Herr zu Dudzele & Straeth+5 d. 1430
2 CONT **Marie de Ghistelles+6,3 d. a 1431
2 CONT *'''Family 2      Maria van Lichtervelde d. 13 Aug 1366
2 CONT *Citations
2 CONT * 1.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VII, Tafel 96, 97.
2 CONT * 2.[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVII, Tafel 66.
2 CONT * 3.[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVII, Tafel 68.
2 CONT * 4.[S2] Detlev Schwennicke, Europaische Stammtafeln, New Series, Vol. XXVII, Tafel 56.
2 CONT * 5.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. XII, Tafel 97.
2 CONT * 6.[S11569] Europaische Stammtafeln, by Wilhelm Karl, Prinz zu Isenburg, Vol. VII, Tafel 97.
2 CONT *From: http://our-royal-titled-noble-and-commoner-ancestors.com/p2856.htm#i85796 ________________________
2 CONT *'''Roger de Ghistelles, seigneur de Dudzeele et de Straten[1, 2, 3]
2 CONT *'''Born  of, Dudzele, West Vlaanderen, Belgium 
2 CONT *Family   Isabeau, dame de Dudzeele, of, Dudzele, West Vlaanderen, Belgium 
2 CONT *Children 
2 CONT **1. Marie de Ghistelles, dame de Zweveghen et de Rosebecque,   b. Abt 1354,   d. Aft 1431
2 CONT **2. Isabelle de Ghistelles,   b. Abt 1369, of, Dudzele, West Vlaanderen, Belgium ,   d. 1435, Schorisse, Oost Vlaanderen, Belgium 
2 CONT *Sources 
2 CONT *1.[S16] #894 Cahiers de Saint-Louis (1976), Louis IX, Roi de France, (Angers: J. Saillot, 1976), FHL book 944 D22ds., vol. 2 p. 45.
2 CONT * 2.[S7] #44 Histoire de la maison royale de France anciens barons du royaume: et des grands officiers de la couronne (1726, reprint 1967-1968), Saint-Marie, Anselme de, (3rd edition. 9 volumes. 1726. Reprint Paris: Editions du Pa
2 CONC lais Royal, 1967-1968), FHL book 944 D5a; FHL microfilms 532,231-532,239., vol. 3 p. 905.
2 CONT * 3.[S39] Medieval, royalty, nobility family group sheets (filmed 1996), Church of Jesus Christ of Latter-day Saints. Family History Department. Medieval Family History Unit, (Manuscript. Salt Lake City, Utah : Filmed by the Genea
2 CONC logical Society of Utah, 1996), FHL film 1553977-1553985.
2 CONT *From: http://histfam.familysearch.org/getperson.php?personID=I20797&tree=EuropeRoyalNobleHous ___________________________
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT 1.        [https://www.geni.com/people/Jean-de-Gavre-Heer-van-Schorisse-Seigneur-d-Escornaix/6000000185362202860 JEAN de Gavre] (-1301).  Goethals confuses him with Jan van Gavre “van den Eyghen”, son of Raso [X] van Gavre Heer va
2 CONC n Liedekerke (see below)[562].  Heer van Schorisse [Seigneur d’Escornaix].  An epitaph at Oudenaarde records the burial of “Jan de Gavre sire d’Escornaij” who died 1301 [?] and “Willemine de Wavrin sa femme”[563].  m [https://www.
2 CONC geni.com/people/Wilhelmine-de-Wavrin/6000000185361590869 WILHELMINE de Wavrin], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Seigneur-de-Wavrin/6000000185361835865 ROBERT [III] Seigneur de Wavrin] & his wife [https://www.geni.c
2 CONC om/people/Isabelle-de-Croisilles/6000000185362221848 Isabelle de Croisilles].  Guy Count of Flanders granted revenue from “la terre de Wavrin, appartenante à ladite Wilhelmine” to “Jean de Gavre Sire d’Escornay et à madame Willelm
2 CONC ine sa femme” by charter dated 17 Oct 1298[564].  An epitaph at Oudenaarde records the burial of “Jan de Gavre sire d’Escornaij” who died 1301 [?] and “Willemine de Wavrin sa femme”[565].  Jean & his wife had children: https://fmg
2 CONC .ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20NOBILITY.htm#ArnaudGavredied1336B
2 CONT
2 CONT >a)         [https://www.geni.com/people/Arnaud-de-Gavre/6000000185362504831 ARNAUD de Gavre] (-after 31 Mar 1336) son of JEAN de Gavre Seigneur d’Escornaix & his wife Wilhelmine de Wavrin (-after 31 Mar 1336).  Goethals records h
2 CONC is parentage without citing any source which confirms the information [567].  Heer van Schorisse [Seigneur d’Escornaix].  An epitaph at Oudenaarde records the burial of “Arnout de Gavre chlr seigneur d’Escornaij” who died 18 Sep 1
2 CONC 316 [?] and “Cathelijne de Rode dame d’Escornaij et d’Asschove” who died 12 Mar 1314 [?][568]. 
2 CONT m [https://www.geni.com/people/Catherine-de-Rodes-dame-d-Escornaij-et-d-Asschove/6000000185361774879 CATHERINE de Rodes], daughter of ---.  Goethals records her family origin and marriage without citing any source which confirms t
2 CONC he information [569].  An epitaph at Oudenaarde records the burial of “Arnout de Gavre chlr seigneur d’Escornaij” who died 18 Sep 1316 [?] and “Cathelijne de Rode dame d’Escornaij et d’Asschove” who died 12 Mar 1314 [?][570]. Arna
2 CONC ud & his wife had children: https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20NOBILITY.htm#ArnaudGavredied1336B
2 CONT
2 CONT >>1.        [https://www.geni.com/profile/index/6000000185361954882 ARNAUD de Gavre] (-1 May 1418).  Goethals records his parentage without citing any source which confirms the information [571].  Baron d’Escornaix 1378.  m [https
2 CONC ://www.geni.com/people/Elisabeth-van-Gistel/6000000185361653909 ELISABETH van Gistel], '''daughter of ROGER van Gistel Heer van Straete & his wife [https://www.geni.com/people/Elisabeth-van-Dudzeele/6000000185361824916 Elisabeth [
2 CONC Margareta] van Dudzeele] (-after 1398).'''  Goethals records her parentage and marriage without citing any source which confirms the information[572].  A charter dated 1398 names “vrauwe Ysabel van Ghistele, twijf mins heere van S
2 CONC chorsche” as holder of “Ter Quinten” in Sint-Walburga parish, held from Veurne[573].  Arnaud & his wife had children: https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20NOBILITY.htm#ArnaudGavredied1336B
