2 CONT M, #688501 Last Edited=20 Sep 2016
2 CONT      Giles de Roët is the son of Eustache IV de Roeulx, Seigneur de Roeulx et de Morlanwetz and Marie de Trith.1 He married Isabeau, Dame de Montreuil.1 Child of Giles de Roët and Isabeau, Dame de Montreuil Payne de Roët+1 b. 1275
2 CONC , d. 1322 Citations [S1916] Tim Boyle, "re: Boyle Family," e-mail message to Darryl Roger Lundy, 16 September 2006. Hereinafter cited as "re: Boyle Family."
2 CONT
