2 CONT Gilles Gerard vaon Roeulx, Heer van Trith & Maing1 Last Edited	4 Apr 2020 M, #156493, b. circa 1235, d. 1280 Father	Eustache IV de Roeulx, Seigneur de Roeulx1 d. Apr 1282 Mother	Marie de Trith1 Charts	Pedigree of James Irvine
2 CONT      Gilles Gerard vaon Roeulx, Heer van Trith & Maing was born circa 1235 at of Le Roeulx, Hennegau, Wallonia, Belgium.1 He married Alix van Ligne, daughter of Fastre de Ligne, Seigneur de Monstreuil and Brigitte de Gavre, circa 
2 CONC 1262.1 Gilles Gerard vaon Roeulx, Heer van Trith & Maing died in 1280 at Henegouwen, Wallonia, Belgium.1 Family Alix van Ligne b. c 1240 Child	 Payen van Roet, Heer van Roet+1 b. c 1275, d. 1322 Citations [S11640] Www.genealogieon
