2 CONT * The Anderson-Krogh genealogy including  ancestral lines / compiled by Lester W. Hansen, page 44 - https://archive.org/details/andersonkroghgen00hans/page/44/mode/2up?q=Sigrid+Gregoriusdatter+Stovreim
2 CONT
