1 NAME Isak Gautesson /Tolga/
2 GIVN Isak Gautesson
2 SURN Tolga
2 _MARNM Talgje Hesbø
2 NICK Gauteson
2 NICK Hesbø
1 NAME Isak Gautesson Talgje-Hesby
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1262
2 PLAC Talgje
2 ADDR
3 STAE Rogaland
3 CTRY Norway
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1303
2 ADDR
3 CITY Ullensvang
