1 NOTE {geni:about_me} http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Angantyr
2 CONT
2 CONT Heidrek "Ulfhamr" Angatyrson, king in Reidgotaland.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father: Angantyr
2 CONT * Wife: Amfelda
2 CONT * Daughter: Hild, mother of Halfdan "Snälle", who was father of Ivar Vidfamne
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: Some genealogies mix him with [http://www.geni.com/people/Hilderic-c480-534-King-of-the-Vandals-523-530/6000000009987656008 Hilderic], second-to-last king of the Vandals. No documentation has been presented for such an assoc
2 CONC iation.
2 CONT
2 CONT Quote:
2 CONT
2 CONT Angantyr was king over Reidgotaland for many years. He was powerful and a great warrior, and from him are descended lines of kings. His son was Heidrek Wolfhide, who succeeded him and ruled long in Reidgotaland. He had a daughter 
2 CONC called Hild. She was the mother of Halfdan Snjalli, father of Ivar the Wide-Grip.
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: The Saga of Hervor King Heidrek the Wise, Epilogue: The Descendents of Angantyr
2 CONT
2 CONT See also http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hervarar_saga
