2 CONT     b. 638; m. Aud Ivarsson; mather of Randver Radbartsson
2 CONT
2 CONT # Reference Number: HPG3-WG
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Ráðbarðr, Raðbarðr or Rathbarth (late 7th century) was a legendary king of Garðaríki (Russia), who appears in Sögubrot and the Lay of Hyndla.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sögubrot tells that he married the fugitive princess Auðr the Deep-Minded without the consent of her father king Ivar Vidfamne, who soon departed to punish his daughter. He died, however, on route, and so Ráðbarðr helped Auð's son
2 CONC  Harald Wartooth claim his maternal grandfather's possessions in Sweden and Denmark.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ráðbarðr and Auðr had a son together named Randver.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT   King of Garderige-Russia; m. Aud Ivarsson; father of Randver. [GRS CD#100]
2 CONT
2 CONT     FOSTER, MINOR, NEWLIN LINES
2 CONT
2 CONT     King of Garderige-Russia; m. Aud, Princess of Sweden; father of Randver. [WFT Vol 5 Ped 3563]
2 CONT
2 CONT     Son of Skirta Ingvarsson; m. Aud 'the Deep Minded' Ivarsdottir; father of:
2 CONT     1. Randver Radbardsson who m. Hyletheansson
2 CONT     2. dau.
2 CONT     [Gary Lewis
2 CONT
2 CONT     b. 638; m. Aud Ivarsdaughter; father of Randver Radbartsson
2 CONT
2 CONT # Reference Number: HPG3-WG
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Aud Djupauga flyktet til Gardariket med sønnen Harald Hildetann og giftet seg med kong Radbart av Gardariket som hun senere fikk sønnen Randver med. Ivar ble oppbrakt over at hans datter hadde giftet seg uten hans tillatelse, og s
2 CONC elv om han var gammel dro han til Gardariket med en stor hær. En natt da de hadde ankret opp i Finskebukten fikk han en merkelig drøm og han spurte sin fosterfar Hord (Hörð) om drømmen. Ivar og hans fosterfar sto på en høy klippe 
2 CONC mens kongen fortalte. Hord mente at drømmen forutså Ivars død og slutten på hans onde handlinger. Rasende over denne drømmetydningen kastet Ivar seg utenfor klippen og ned i sjøen. Deretter gjorde Hord det samme.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ettersom både den danske som den svenske tronen var ledig dro Auds sønn Harald fra Gardariket og til Skåne for å kreve sin rett og med støtte fra sin stefar Radbart.
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT King of Garderidge. First name aka Radbard.
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Var möjligtvis Ragnar "Lodbrok" Sigurdsson fadern?
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Radbard av Sverige (Mythical) was born circa 638. Of the 7th Century Saga line. He witnessed the death of Ivarr Vídfadmi Hálfdanarson, King of the Danes and Swedes in 647; He died while sailing for Russia, where he set out to puni
2 CONC sh his daughter's new husband for marrying Oda without permission, and to do some plundering as well. His boat sank and he drowned in the frigid waters of the Gulf of Finland.1,2 Radbard av Sverige (Mythical) was left Sweden and e
2 CONC stablished a settlement in Russia, becoming King of this settlement before 668. He married Auda Ivarsdóttir, daughter of Ivarr Vídfadmi Hálfdanarson, King of the Danes and Swedes and Gyrita of Jutland, circa 668; Her 2nd. Her love
2 CONC r, Helge the Viking dead at the hands of her husband, Rurik, and Rurik dead at the hands of her father, Ivar, Oda took Harold and left for the Swedish settlements in Russia. There she married King Radbard. Her father disapproved o
2 CONC f the marriage, done without his permission.
2 CONT
