1 NOTE RESIDENCE: Bosatte seg på Lade ved Trondheim 
2 CONT OCCUPATION: Ladejarl
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH: ABT 0860, (?) 
2 CONT DEATH: 0900, Stavanesvågen, Sunnfjord (i kamp) 
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT Snorre
1 NOTE RESEARCH NOTES:
2 CONT Earl
1 NOTE SOURCE NOTES:
2 CONT www.dcs.hull.ac.uk/cgi-bin/gedlkup/n=royal?royal18548+
2 CONT Bu573
