2 CONT 1995.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ragnvald Eysteinsson le Sage.
2 CONT
2 CONT Alan B. Wilson, July 1997, soc.genealogy.medieval. Rognvald
2 CONT Eysteinsson the Wise, Jarl of More, born cira 830 in More, Norway.
2 CONT
2 CONT GenServ database SMIA7MT, December 1998. Rognvald I, born about 857.
2 CONT Of Upland, Denmark. Died in the Orkney Islands.
2 CONT
2 CONT LDS Ancestral File, 4 November 2001. Born circa 830. Died 890/894
2 CONT at Orkney, Orkney Islands, Scotland.
