1 NOTE         King of Vestfold about 780. He was also called the "Bad Entertainer" as he did not feed his men well. He married Liv, daughter of King Dag of Vestmare and lived at the Holte farm. He became ill and died in his bed. They ha
2 CONC d at least two sons; Oystein and Gudrod.
