2 CONT =Eyvind Skaldaspiller Finsson= 
2 CONT * Son of Finn "Skjalge" Eivindsson and Gunhild Halvdansdatter 
2 CONT * Eyvindr Finnsson skáldaspillir was a 10th-century Norwegian skald. He was the court poet of king Hákon the Good and earl Hákon of Hlaðir. His son Hárekr later became a prominent chieftain in Norway.
2 CONT
