2 CONT * Det Norske geografiske selskabs aarbok, Volumes 10-12,By Norske Geografiske Selskab, Oslo - https://books.google.com/books?id=dPAuAAAAYAAJ&pg=RA2-PA83&lpg=RA2-PA83&dq=Raud+from+%C3%96sterdalen&source=bl&ots=MTJ5QuE1ev&sig=ACfU3U
2 CONC 3avqObFkf_n6jjuA4EIJQQCBKk-w&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjO__LOu7ruAhVBLn0KHVnPAa44ChDoATASegQIEhAB#v=onepage&q=Raud%20from%20%C3%96sterdalen&f=false
