2 CONC nd Dag were leaders in the battle of Stiklestad in 1030. If this is Ring Dagsson, he must have either fallen in the battle or died shortly after. In that case, contrary to what is said about his brother Rørek, he must have reconci
2 CONC led with King Olav after his exile.
