2 CONC ur de Wissocq, Bailiff of Bailleul and Jacqueline de Ste. Aldegonde, circa 1328.1 Jeanne de Haveskerke died in 1364 at of St. Omer, Pas-de-Calais, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.1
