1 NOTE {geni:about_me} DuBois --- Geoffri DuBois born about 1046 married Idoine Tesson of the Cotentin Penisula. Geoffri was one of the Chevaliers who accompanied William the Conqueror for the invasion of England in 1066. As one of the o
2 CONC ldest families in France, the du Bois family had many marriages with other families. It is written that Lady Colle, also known as Colle de Luxembourg, was a descendent of Geofri du Bois.
2 CONT
