2 CONT
2 CONT Clothilde de Ste. Aldegonde was born circa 1274 at of St. Omer, Pas-de-Calais, Nord-Pas-de-Calais, France.1 She married Denis de St. Omer, Seigneur de Moerbeke, son of Guillaume VII de St. Omer, Chatelain de St. Omer, Comte de Fau
2 CONC quemberque and Marie de Varennes, circa 1295.1 Clothilde de Ste. Aldegonde died in 1334.1
