2 CONT -------------------- Agne, Agni, Hogne or Agni Skjálfarbondi was a mythological king of Sweden, of the House of Yngling.
2 CONT
2 CONT Snorri Sturluson relates that he was the son of Dag the Wise, and he was mighty and famous. He was also skilled in many ways.
2 CONT
2 CONT One summer, he went to Finland with his army where he pillaged. The Finns gathered a vast host under a chief named Frosti.
2 CONT
