2 CONT
2 CONT Children by Ragnvald I "The Wise" (married c. 867):  
2 CONT '''# Ivar RAGNVALDSSON,   d. Yes''' 
2 CONT $ Thorer 'The Silent' RAGNVALDSSON, Jarl Of More,   d. date unknown 
2 CONT # Robert Rollo ROGNAVALDSSON, 1st,   b. 870, County Of Möre Og Romsdal, Norway ,   d. 932, Notre Dame, Rouen, Normandie, Neustria  
2 CONT # Hrollager Of MORE,   d. date unknown 
