1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Dudo of Saint-Quentin in his ''Historia Normannorum'' gives Rollo a younger brother named '''Gurim'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT Some scholars link Gurim, or Gorm, with the progenitor of the Montgomery family https://www.geni.com/people/Gurim-Gommer/6000000008537413124 - but Gurim of Dudo's story is killed before the story really takes off.
2 CONT
2 CONT The assumption that Gutum is a son of Ragnvald is based on Snorre's claim that Rollo is a son of Ragnvald, which means that Dudo was wrong about Rollo's parentage, so this profile is a synthesis based on half-believing Dudo and ha
2 CONC lf-believing Snorre.
