2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Eivind Skaldespiller 
2 CONT * Chief and farmer. Parents: Skald Øyvind Finnsson Shellfisher (ca. 920 – ca. 990); the mother unknown. Married to Ragnhild Arnesdatter, daughter of Arne Arnmodsson and Tora Torsteinsdatter.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Chapter 3.    DESCENDANTS of FIN SKJALGE=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Project MedLands Norway Nobility'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''FIN Skjalge,''' son of --- . 
2 CONT '''married GUNHILD Halfdansdatter, daughter of HALFDAN Jarl & his wife Ingeborg of Norway [illegitimate daughter of HARALD I "Harfagri" King of Norway].'''  Snorre names Gunhild as the daughter of Halfdan & his wife[65].  Snorre n
2 CONC ames Gunhild, daughter of Earl Halfdan and Ingebjorg, as the mother of Harek's father[66]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Fin Skjalge & his wife GUNHILD Halfdansdatter had two children'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * 1.         '''EYVIND Skaldaspiller''' (-990).  Pöt.  m ---.  The name of Eyvind´s wife is not known.  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Eyvind & his wife had one child'''
2 CONT
