1 NOTE     Ruled Norway from 970 - 995 with his uncle Harald Blietooth.
2 CONT     Description: murder by the hand of a peasant named Kark.
1 NOTE He was the illegitemate son of Håkon Ladejarl.
1 NOTE RESIDENCE: Ladejarl i Hålogaland 995-1017 
2 CONT OCCUPATION: Jarl i Norge 1000-1015
2 CONT
2 CONT BIRTH: ABT 0980 
2 CONT DEATH: ABT 1023 
2 CONT BURIAL: (Styrte Norge fra 1000 sm.m. br. Svein) 
1 NOTE Eirik Jarl, ca. 964  ca. 1024.
2 CONT Konge ca. 1000 - 1014
2 CONT Eldste sønn av Håkon Ladejarl.
