2 CONC ative married to Tora, daughter to the King of Denmark, of whom the name of Grant is descended; Svend is the third son, married to Imgcharg, daughter to Olaus King of Sweden - of them are the two great families of Breide in Holste
2 CONC in and the Prince of Cimberne in Germany descended. Hacken was the name of the fourth Son, he was married to Helena, Daughter to the Earl of Darley in England; and Peter, begotten in fornication, was his fifth son, he was Stuart t
