1 NAME Jean "Guingard" /Malet/ II
2 GIVN Jean "Guingard"
2 SURN Malet
2 NSFX II
2 _MARNM Malet
1 NAME Jean II Malet, seigneur de Graville
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1265
1 DEAT
2 DATE ABT 1340
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/normacre.htm#JeanIIMaletdiedafter1328
2 CONT
2 CONT *1.         [JEAN [I] Malet (-after 1285). .. <br>  m JEANNE, daughter of --- (-after Nov 1264).  ..
2 CONT
2 CONT **a)     '''    [JEAN [II] Malet''' (-after 1328).  Duchesne names “Jean Malet II...seigneur de Gueraville, Sées et Bernay” as son of Jean [I][1006].  Père Anselme records that Jean [II] was the son of Jean [I] Malet without citin
2 CONC g the corresponding primary source[1007]. The primary source which confirms his parentage has not been identified.  Seigneur de Graville.  Père Anselme records that Jean [II] was knighted in 1313, was commanded to Paris 12 Nov 131
2 CONC 8 for a campaign against the Flemish, and fought at Maraux in Flanders in 1328, without citing the corresponding primary sources[1008].]  <br> '''m''' ANNE de Wavrin, daughter of ROBERT de Wavrin Seigneur de Saint-Venant & his [fi
2 CONC rst] wife [Marie de Roye].  Duchesne names Catherine as daughter of “Jean Malet II...seigneur de Gueraville, Sées et Bernay...[et sa] femme Anne de S. Venant fille de Robert Seigneur de Sainct-Venant” as wife of “Jean Malet II...s
2 CONC eigneur de Gueraville, Sées et Bernay”[1009].  Père Anselme names her “Anne alias Jeanne de Wavrin fille de Robert de Wavrin seigneur de S. Venant”, noting that her husband through her received payments from the treasury in Mar 13
2 CONC 15, which were due from “la forêt de Fontaines au pays de Caux” in 1317[1010].  The primary source which confirms her parentage and marriage has not been identified.]  <br> ''Jean [II] & his wife had [three children]: ''
2 CONT
2 CONT ***i)          [JEAN [III] Malet (-Rouen 13 Apr 1355, bur 23 Dec 1357 Rouen Cathedral).  .. <br> m ANNE, daughter of --- (-after 1345). ..
2 CONT ***ii)         [GUILLAUME Malet (-after 1339).  ..
2 CONT
2 CONT ***iii)        [CATHERINE Malet (-22 Feb 1331, bur Sainte-Marie de Beaulieu).  .. <br>  m JEAN de Préaux, son of --- (-[11 Jun] [1330], bur Sainte-Marie de Beaulieu).] 
