1 NAME Jean III Malet, seigneur de Graville
1 SEX M
1 DEAT
2 DATE 5 APR 1355
2 ADDR
3 CITY Rouen
3 STAE Upper Normandy
3 CTRY France
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} -https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/normacre.htm#JeanIIMaletdiedafter1328
2 CONT
2 CONT i)      '''    [JEAN [III] Malet''' (-Rouen 13 Apr 1355, bur 23 Dec 1357 Rouen Cathedral).  Duchesne names Jean [III] as older son of Jean [II] Malet[1011].  The primary source which records his parentage has not been identified. 
2 CONC  [A charter of Graville priory records “Ioannes Mallet miles et dominus de Girardivilla...cum Ioanna uxore sua” donating property dated Nov 1264, and “alter Ioannes Mallet dominus de Girardivilla cum uxore Anna” in 1345[1012].  
2 CONT
2 CONT '''m''' ANNE, daughter of --- (-after 1345).  A charter of Graville priory records “Ioannes Mallet miles et dominus de Girardivilla...cum Ioanna uxore sua” donating property dated Nov 1264, and “alter Ioannes Mallet dominus de Gir
2 CONC ardivilla cum uxore Anna” in 1345[1013].  It is not certain to which Jean Malet the second entry refers, but the chronology suggests that it was Jean [III].] 
1 FAMC @F6000000015715068860@
1 RFN geni:6000000015443667132
1 SUBM @S6000000003658727010@
1 CHAN
2 DATE 25 MAY 2024
3 TIME 14:27:16
