2 CONC her “Marie”) and two marriages (reversing their order) (no sources cited)[867].  As noted above under her husband, Espinoy names her “Dame Marie de Guistelles, Dame de Zweueghem et de Rosebeke”.  Vredius quotes a manuscript which 
2 CONC records that “messire Loys de Frise fils bastard de...Loys de Male conte de Flandre...” married “madame...de Ghistelles...fille de messire --- Seigneur de Dudzeele” who later married “--- de Halewijn”[868].  Vredius quotes another
