2 CONC ayed on the epitaph of her granddaughter (by her second marriage) Isabelle.  Some doubt about Marie’s name is introduced by the charter dated 25 Apr 1435 which names “Pierre de Boulers escuier”, married to “Margaretha van Halewijn
