2 CONC  citing any source which confirms the information[575].  Baron d’Escornaix.  An epitaph at Escornaix records “Arnould de Gavre chevalier seigneur d’Escornaix, de Dieudonné, de Faye” who died 11 Sep 1476 and “Sibille de Ligne, dame
2 CONC  d’Escornaix, de Romagies et de Fayel” who died 26 Jul “1418” [error][576].  '''m [https://www.geni.com/people/Sybille-de-Ligne/6000000015122257032?through=6000000015121625585 SIBYLLE de Ligne], daughter of [https://www.geni.com/p
