2 CONC Barbançon] (-26 Jul 1468, bur Escornaix).  Goethals records her parentage and marriage without citing any source which confirms the information[577].  An epitaph at Escornaix records “Arnould de Gavre chevalier seigneur d’Escornai
2 CONC x, de Dieudonné, de Faye” who died 11 Sep 1476 and “Sibille de Ligne, dame d’Escornaix, de Romagies et de Fayel” who died 26 Jul “1418” [error][578].'''  Arnaud & his wife had one child: https://fmg.ac/Projects/MedLands/FLEMISH%20
