1 NAME Sir Payn Roelt /Payne Roët de Guyenne King of Arms
1 NAME Paen/ Payn de Roet
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1310
2 ADDR
3 CITY Brunehaut
3 STAE Wallonia
3 CTRY Belgium
1 BURI
2 DATE 1380
