0 @N6000000002187913587@ NOTE Ingjald Olofsson
1 CONT From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia
1 CONT
1 CONT Ingjald Olofsson was the son of Olof Trätälja and became the king of Värmland after his death. When Ingjald died, his brother Halfdan Hvitbeinn made Värmland part of his kingdom.
