1 CONT OCCU King of Vestvol ...
1 CONT SOUR members.aol.com/sargen3;www.public.asu.edu/bgertz/family/d0000 ;
1 CONT SOUR COMYNI.GED (Compuserve), #1518;
1 CONT Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 123;
1 CONT Halfdan "White-Leg" King of Upplanders - COMYNI.GED (Compuserve), #1518;
1 CONT Halfdan Olafsson "Huitbein" (white leg), King of the Uplanders of Sweden, King
1 CONT of Salver and Vestfold; conquered Roumarike; founded the pagan temple at Skir-
1 CONT ingssal, 8th century; Note: Unlike other sources I have used, Moncreiffe(chart
1 CONT 35, p. 109) adds 2 generations between my Gen. 40 [Gudrod Halfdansson] and Gen
1 CONT 41 [Halfdan Olafsson]: Halfdan "the Stingy," King of Vestfold...cont.in notes
1 CONT HALFDAN I, son of OLAF and SOLVEIG HALFDANNSON: , as father of Gudrod, whom he calls Godfrey the Proud; whose father was (41A) Eystein the Fart, King of Roumarkike. Though the work carries no
1 CONT bibliography, Moncreiffe was an outstanding authority, and
1 CONT pending proof otherwise, may well be considered correct - Royalty for Commoners, Roderick W. Stuart, p. 124
1 CONT
1 CONT OCCU King Salver, Uplands[Spare.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT [daveanthes.FTW]
1 CONT
1 CONT Halfdan 'Huitbein' Olafsson King of the Uplanders of Sweden
1 CONT Founded the pagan temple at Skiringssal.
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Father: Olaf The Wood Cutter INGJALDSSON b: 682 in Vaermland, Sweden
1 CONT Mother: Solveig HALFDANSDOTTER b: 698 in Sweden
1 CONT
1 CONT Marriage 1 Asa Eysteinsdotter THRONDHEIM b: 715 in Uppland, Norway
1 CONT
1 CONT
1 CONT Children
1 CONT
1 CONT    1. Has Children Eystein Halfdansson King in RAUMARIKE b: 733 in Norway
1 CONT    2. Has Children Gudrod Halfdansson King in HEIDARK b: ABT 738 in Vestfold, Norway
1 CONT
