0 @N6000000001421033452@ NOTE [hezboone.FTW]
1 CONT !Per "My Boone Family":  In one of his Viking raids against Norway, Eystein captured the king's daughter and married her.  When Huntasfar died, Eystein inherited his wife's clan rulership and was able to return to Norway.
