1 CONT PLAC Duc de Normandie - 'Gonge Rolf' (The Ganger)Norwegian Viking settled at mouth of Seine. After fighting many battles, made an agreement with King Charles the Simple - received land in Normandie
1 CONT  and 911 became 1st Duc de Normandie and vassel of King.
